 "text": "Hey there, how are you? They generally earn it with the big weddings. Is there wedding you' looking at specifically? Then a planner can save you a lot of grief. Which would you rather spend your energy on, planning the big day or digging out each receipt? It means just one day. You' work with the planner on the week that suits you, and they'll take care of everything. It is, and for someone who gets it, she'll love you forever. Lots of people do, their parents. You can always ask her if she'd help you with the one day you have, and then keep the wedding planning to yourself. The key is being honest with her about why you want her.",
